  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat(cli): initial version of generation .http files from openapi 2025-03-06\n- feat: ApiExceptions now will show json instead ReasonPhrase for all possible cases. 2025-02-28\n- feat: Now need to mark all SourceGenerator AdditionalFiles with AutoSDK_OpenApiSpecification = true explicitly. 2025-02-26\n- feat: Improved generation for TargetFramework=net9. 2025-02-07\n- feat: Added some default JsonSerializerContextTypes. 2025-01-07\n- feat: Added Cohere AllOf inheritance/polymorphism support. 2024-12-18\n- feat: Added x-enum-descriptions support. 2024-12-07\n- feat: Added authorization methods to client interfaces. 2024-11-27\n- feat: Now HttpClient will try to use HTTP/3.0 or HTTP/2.0 if available 2024-11-27\n- feat: Added additional format support like decimal/char/short/byte. 2024-11-27\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: Fixed nullable enum in query bug. 2025-02-26\n- fix: Fixed bug with latest Anthropic spec. 2025-02-26\n- fix: Use Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp 4.3.1 for source generators 2025-02-26\n- fix: Fixed Reverse() bug 2025-02-26\n- fix: Fixed OpenAI usage in CLI. 2025-02-07\n- fix: Added GenerateEndPointAttributes to reduce code duplication and fix issues. 2025-01-07\n- fix: Fixed Experimental attribute namespace. 2025-01-07\n- fix: Fixed issues with AllOf polymorphism. 2024-12-22\n- fix: Fixed serialization issue for some enums. 2024-12-09\n- fix: Fixed bug with pattern status codes like 4XX. 2024-12-09",
